    "updated_at": "2023-10-05T16:41:38Z",
    "body": "I think web-platform-tests/wpt#29820 should now be sufficiently updated, and part of it is now split into web-platform-tests/wpt#42364.\r\n\r\nI'm a little unsure about filing an MDN issue.  Right now neither https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Global_attributes/dir nor https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Global_attributes/lang goes into sufficient detail that they'd be affected by any of the changes here.  That said, maybe it's possible that they should *mention* inheritance, although I'm not sure they should go into anything at the level of detail that would be changed by the changes here.",
